WEBVTT

00:24:59.244 --> 00:25:01.371
we actually transform the whole world.

00:25:01.412 --> 00:25:02.580
MR: Yeah.

00:25:02.580 --> 00:25:06.000
Well, Vanessa, all I can say is
I have really enjoyed this conversation.

00:25:06.000 --> 00:25:07.168
And I hope you have.

00:25:07.210 --> 00:25:09.003
VN: Yes, I have, thank you so much.

00:25:09.045 --> 00:25:13.383
It was a lovely conversation,
and I had so much to learn from you.